    "text": "By Sammy Approved ,\n8 hours ago This incident highlights ongoing issue of 'living while Black' and the burden of constant scrutiny in ordinary situations. A Black father says what should have been a relaxing day at the pool with his children turned into a painful reminder that ordinary moments can quickly become anything but ordinary. The father says police were called after he refused to show his ID at a Chicago apartment complex pool. Read full article",
